## Context
1274 specified that review_notes.py gate syncs (fetch, merge, push) before ruling; 1281 added a read-only refresh but
left gate_state on the full sync. A gate host that may only read cannot rule.

## Exit criteria
- [ ] gate_state reads through refresh (no push) and the verdict write remains the only push.
- [ ] A test rules on a remote that refuses pushes.
- [ ] The harness gate passes.

Related: [[1274]], [[1281]].
